Falsifies `e1000e::receive_proofs::a_receive_reads_only_its_own_slot_and_no_more_than_the_caller_has_room_for`.

The defect: the receive path reads the frame from the buffer of the descriptor after the one it
consumed, so the caller gets another descriptor's bytes and the descriptor it consumed keeps its
frame unread.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(offset == layout::receive_buffer(slot))` in
`read_bytes`, at the first delivered frame.

diff --git a/src/data_plane.rs b/src/data_plane.rs
index 123e2f8..25d7218 100644
--- a/src/data_plane.rs
+++ b/src/data_plane.rs
@@ -158,7 +158,7 @@ impl DataPlane {
             tails.barrier();
             let got = match verdict {
                 ReceiveVerdict::Frame(n) => {
-                    region.read_bytes(layout::receive_buffer(self.receive_next), &mut out[..n]);
+                    region.read_bytes(layout::receive_buffer(self.receive_next + 1), &mut out[..n]);
                     Some(n)
                 }
